+
 Payment flow you're integrating (See full diagram at https://docs.stripe.com/payments/without-card-authentication)
 
+```text
+[Customer] -- Provides card details and clicks Pay button --> [Client]
+[Client] -- Calls stripe.createPaymentMethod --> [Stripe]
+[Stripe] -- Returns PaymentMethod --> [Client]
+[Client] -- Finalizes payment with order details and PaymentMethod ID --> [Server]
+[Server] -- POST /v1/payment_intents confirm=true --> [Stripe]
+[Stripe] -- Attempts payment --> [Stripe]
+[Stripe] -- If no authentication required, returns new PaymentIntent with status “succeeded” --> [Server]
+[Stripe] -- Attempts payment --> [Stripe]
+[Stripe] -- If authentication required, returns new Error with code “authentication_required” --> [Server]
+```
